{"body": "Currently, orphaned files are collected at the driver before deletion. This can overwhelm the driver when dealing with millions of orphaned files.\nThis change introduces distributed deletion (with a default parallelism of 10, to avoid throttling), which avoids sending results back to the driver. The operation will return the total count of deleted files.\nFor backward compatibility, the results will still include the full paths of all orphaned files by default, which can be configured.\nTODO\n\n Make the distributed delete parallelism configurable\n Uncache the dataframe", "date": "2025-05-16T22:28:06Z", "hash": "sha256:562697294460e03b9040", "id": "gh:apache/iceberg#13084", "meta": {"additions": 149, "base": "main", "closed_at": "2025-07-19T00:18:23Z", "comments": 11, "deletions": 67, "draft": false, "files": [".palantir/revapi.yml", "api/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/actions/DeleteOrphanFiles.java", "core/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/util/SerializableConsumer.java", "spark/v3.4/spark/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/spark/actions/DeleteOrphanFilesSparkAction.java", "spark/v3.5/spark/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/spark/actions/DeleteOrphanFilesSparkAction.java", "spark/v3.5/spark/src/test/java/org/apache/iceberg/spark/actions/TestRemoveOrphanFilesAction.java", "spark/v4.0/spark/src/main/java/org/apache/iceberg/spark/actions/DeleteOrphanFilesSparkAction.java"], "labels": ["API", "spark", "core", "stale"], "n_files": 7, "number": 13084, "repo": "apache/iceberg", "reviews": [{"at": "2025-06-09T11:27:00Z", "by": "steveloughran", "state": "COMMENTED"}], "state": "closed", "thumbs_up": 0, "updated_at": "2025-07-19T00:18:23Z"}, "people": ["karuppayya"], "refs": [], "source": "github", "title": "Prevent driver from overwhelming during orphan file removal", "type": "pr", "url": "https://github.com/apache/iceberg/pull/13084"}
